---
// About.astro
---

<section class="section about-section" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <!-- Text -->
      <div class="about-text reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">About</span>
        <h2 class="section-title" id="about-heading">
          Who <span class="title-accent">I Am</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="about-para">
          I'm a <strong>Data Science student at IIT Madras</strong> focused on AI engineering
          and intelligent systems. My path to tech started with a simple question —
          <em>"How does this work?"</em> — and that curiosity still drives everything I build.
        </p>

        <p class="about-para">
          I enjoy taking ideas from research papers and turning them into working software.
          Whether it's a multi-agent system that collaborates to analyse a dataset, a GAN
          that upscales plant leaf imagery, or an RL agent that audits AI model cards for
          regulatory compliance — I care about the <strong>engineering</strong> behind the idea,
          not just the idea itself.
        </p>

        <p class="about-para">
          Beyond code, I'm drawn to physics, relativity and sci-fi. I also have an artistic
          side — music, poetry, singing. I believe the best technologists appreciate
          <strong>all dimensions of human experience</strong>, not just the technical ones.
        </p>

        <p class="about-para about-trajectory">
          Right now I'm moving toward frontier AI engineering — GPU programming, LLM systems,
          distributed training, and agentic architectures. The goal is to build things that matter.
        </p>

        <div class="about-links">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/24f1002299"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn btn-secondary"
            aria-label="Visit GitHub profile"
          >
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.3 3.438 9.8 8.205 11.385.6.113.82-.258.82-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23A11.509 11.509 0 0112 5.803c1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576C20.566 21.797 24 17.3 24 12c0-6.63-5.373-12-12-12z"/>
            </svg>
            GitHub
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/hasrat-hussain-08b637233/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn btn-secondary"
            aria-label="Visit LinkedIn profile"
          >
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433c-1.144 0-2.063-.926-2.063-2.065 0-1.138.92-2.063 2.063-2.063 1.14 0 2.064.925 2.064 2.063 0 1.139-.925 2.065-2.064 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/>
            </svg>
            LinkedIn
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Code visual -->
      <div class="about-visual reveal reveal-d2" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="code-window glass">
          <div class="code-titlebar">
            <span class="dot dot-red"></span>
            <span class="dot dot-amber"></span>
            <span class="dot dot-green"></span>
            <span class="code-filename">hasrat.ts</span>
          </div>
          <pre class="code-body"><code><span class="kw">const</span> <span class="var">hasrat</span> = &#123;
  <span class="prop">name</span>:      <span class="str">"Hasrat Hussain"</span>,
  <span class="prop">role</span>:      <span class="str">"AI/ML Engineer"</span>,
  <span class="prop">studying</span>: <span class="str">"Data Science @ IIT Madras"</span>,
  <span class="prop">builds</span>: [
    <span class="str">"AI Agents"</span>,
    <span class="str">"LLM Systems"</span>,
    <span class="str">"Computer Vision"</span>,
    <span class="str">"Production APIs"</span>,
  ],
  <span class="prop">values</span>: &#123;
    <span class="prop">engineering</span>: <span class="bool">true</span>,
    <span class="prop">curiosity</span>:   <span class="bool">true</span>,
    <span class="prop">craft</span>:       <span class="bool">true</span>,
  &#125;,
  <span class="prop">exploring</span>: [<span class="str">"CUDA"</span>, <span class="str">"LLM Systems"</span>],
&#125;;</code></pre>
        </div>

        <!-- Education card -->
        <div class="edu-card glass">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5zM6 12v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5"/>
          </svg>
          <div>
            <p class="edu-degree">BSc in Data Science &amp; Applications</p>
            <p class="edu-school">Indian Institute of Technology, Madras</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section { background: var(--bg-surface); }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--s-16);
    align-items: center;
  }

  /* Text */
  .about-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--s-6);
  }

  .about-para {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .about-para strong { color: var(--text-primary); font-weight: 600; }
  .about-para em     { color: var(--cyan); font-style: normal; }

  .about-trajectory {
    padding: var(--s-4);
    background: var(--cyan-dim);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--cyan);
    border-radius: 0 var(--r-md) var(--r-md) 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .about-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--s-4);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  /* Visual */
  .about-visual {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--s-4);
  }

  .code-window {
    overflow: hidden;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .code-titlebar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--s-2);
    padding: var(--s-3) var(--s-4);
    background: var(--bg-overlay);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .dot { width: 11px; height: 11px; border-radius: 50%; }
  .dot-red   { background: #ff5f57; }
  .dot-amber { background: #febc2e; }
  .dot-green { background: #28c840; }

  .code-filename {
    margin-left: var(--s-3);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .code-body {
    padding: var(--s-5);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
    overflow-x: auto;
    white-space: pre;
  }

  .kw   { color: #FF7B72; }
  .var  { color: #79C0FF; }
  .prop { color: var(--cyan); }
  .str  { color: #A5D6FF; }
  .bool { color: #FF7B72; }

  /* Education card */
  .edu-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--s-4);
    padding: var(--s-4) var(--s-5);
    color: var(--cyan);
  }
  .edu-degree { font-size: var(--text-sm); font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 0.2rem; }
  .edu-school { font-size: var(--text-xs); color: var(--text-muted); }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .about-grid { gap: var(--s-10); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .about-visual { order: -1; }
  }
</style>
